  "_comment": "Curated official baseline (rank 2). Rows written directly by a rank-1 API — the NDRRMA named rescue registry and its Nepali/foreign split, the rescue-system log, the comms-tower status — are deliberately NOT listed here. They used to be, and because this feed carries no source rank it silently overwrote the live API values on every refresh cycle. See _API_OWNED_ROWS in assets/app.js. Keep updated_at honest: once it is more than 36 hours old this feed demotes itself below Wikipedia so the site keeps advancing on its own.",
